  "reflectionText": "Hannah lifted up her voice in the courts at Shiloh after she had given Samuel into Eli's keeping, and the song she sang turned the order of the world upside down. What is it for a mother to give back the only child she had asked for, with a song the kingdoms had not yet sung?"
